    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "契約更新の朝。「更新後の勤務週・第一週」耳が、ぴんと立つ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "二年目、始まった。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "掲示板が、去年の顔ぶれのまま。……あれ?街の暦は、第一週からやり直すものらしい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "妙といえば妙だけど、控えを取って仕事にかかる。二年目の朝は、忙しい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.direction.mimi.shift.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w01.asset.sprite.mimi.tsukkomi",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "朝礼は、二年目の目標会議になった。「連覇」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「全員の契約の解放」「新しい仲間」みんな、去年をぜんぶ覚えてた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "話が早い。会議は三分で白熱、三十分で脱線。……いつも通りだ。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "窓口に、白ひげの剣士さんが来た。「世界を三度すくった者だが」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「ポイント五倍は、今日です」「——ほう。話が早いのう」判を押すと、じっと見られた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「……あんた、二年目の顔をしとるな」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.004d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.004d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……良い顔ってことにしておこう。耳が、ちょっとこそばゆい。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.direction.mimi.shift.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w01.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "闘技場の正面に、見慣れない垂れ幕。「アルデバラン社・再演企画室」去年の、あの部署だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "名前を変えて、今年の元締めの席に座った。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "初仕事の貼り紙が、受付にあった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「近日開演——名場面リバイバル公演(主催: 再演企画室)」演目の欄は、まだ白い。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……誰の名場面を、誰の許しで?",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "去年、会社に「管理」されかけて、撥ね返した。今年は、興行で来た。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "なら、受けて立つ場所は決まってる。砂の上と、客席の数だ。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「連覇。そして——会社のやり方と、決着をつける」書き終えた字は、去年より少しだけ太くなってた。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "閉場の鐘が鳴る。赤い受付の上着を返した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "黒い接客服に戻ると、肩が少し軽い。今日も、飲み物を出す手だけは止めなかった。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "経理課から「契約更新——受理済み」の控え。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w01.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……申請した覚え、ないんですけど。二年目の最初の一手、今夜決めよう。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "main.s2.w01.choice.001",
          "label": "目標を、控室に大きく貼り出す",
          "result": "半紙に太筆で書いて、控室のいちばん見える壁に貼った。目標は、貼ると強くなる。カジノの「本日の大当たり」と同じ理屈だ。ノノさんが横に、小さく貼り足す。「今年も、安全第一」",
          "intent": "二年目の旗を、最初に高く揚げる",
          "promise": "チームの向きが揃う代わりに、会社にもこちらの本気が伝わる",
          "memory": "太筆の目標が、控室の壁で一年を見下ろす",
          "outcomeAssetId": "main.s2.w01.asset.outcome.001",
          "tone": "heroic",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "sharedPoints",
              "amount": 2
            }
          ],
          "goto": "main.s2.w01.node.end.001"
        },
        {
          "id": "main.s2.w01.choice.002",
          "label": "まず、会社の新体制を調べる",
          "result": "旗より先に、敵を知る。ノノさんと手分けして、再演企画室の輪郭を洗った。前身は物語資産管理部、室長は昨年末に就任。所管は「終了済み興行の再活用」——つまり、終わった物語の商売だ。メモは薄い束。強い相手ほど、名刺は薄い。",
          "intent": "戦う前に、相手の輪郭を測る",
          "promise": "敵情が手に入る代わりに、旗揚げは一歩あとになる",
          "memory": "再演企画室の調べのメモが、帳場の引き出しに入った",
          "outcomeAssetId": "main.s2.w01.asset.outcome.002",
          "tone": "pragmatic",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "sharedPoints",
              "amount": 2
            }
          ],
          "goto": "main.s2.w01.node.end.001"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s2.w01.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
